    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Trois destins familiaux entrelac\u00e9s. Jos\u00e9phine et Tomas viennent de se marier dans l\u2019all\u00e9gresse. Mais bient\u00f4t, derri\u00e8re le bonheur solaire des \u00e9poux, les parents de Jos\u00e9phine vont d\u00e9couvrir une r\u00e9alit\u00e9 plus sombre. M\u00e9lanie, elle, annonce \u00e0 ses parents qu\u2019elle attend un b\u00e9b\u00e9 mais le p\u00e8re de l\u2019enfant n\u2019a pas du tout le profil du gendre id\u00e9al ! De son c\u00f4t\u00e9, Anthony, \u00e9tudiant lunaire et malheureux en amour, va devoir prendre en charge sa m\u00e8re, devenue soudainement incontr\u00f4lable.",
        "english": "The fates of three entwined families. Jos\u00e9phine and Tomas have just got married. It was a joyful celebration. But soon, Jos\u00e9phine's parents will discover a darker side lurking behind the couple's sunny happiness. Meanwhile, M\u00e9lanie tells her parents that she is pregnant but the child's father does not fit the bill of the ideal son-in-law. As for Anthony, a dreamy student and unlucky in love, he must take care of his mother, who has suddenly become uncontrollable."
